{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_2_observability","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_2_observability","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Notation"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_2_observability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_2_observability","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L27-L39","doc":"**Lemma statement** (from manuscript):\n\nFor $\\mathbf{C} = \\mathbf{Rep}(U_{q}(\\mathfrak{g}))$ at generic $q$\nand $A = \\mathcal{O}_{q}(G)$,\n$\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}, \\mathrm{Ad}(A)) = 0$\nmodulo the unit, verifying axiom~(2) of\n[quantum observable universe](#def:quantum-observable-universe).\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:qou-exists-axiom-2","label":"lem:qou-exists-axiom-2","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-2.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.total_hom_dim_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.total_hom_dim_eq","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The only invariants are scalars, so the total invariant space has dimension 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.hom_dim_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.hom_dim_eq","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Modulo the unit summand means we subtract 1 from the total dimension. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.total_hom_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.total_hom_dim","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L21-L21","doc":"The total dimension of invariants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.hom_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.hom_dim","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L19-L19","doc":"Dimension of `Hom_C(𝟙, Ad(A))` modulo the unit summand. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom2ObservabilityContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean#L15-L25","doc":"Abstract context for the `exists_axiom_2_observability` claim — manuscript-themed\ntyped fields below; `holds` carries the residual `Prop` claim. ","signatureChunk":0}]}